### What Each Package Does:

| Package | Purpose | Command |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`serve`** | Spins up a fast local web server to test the app on `http://localhost:3000` | `npm start` |
| **`gh-pages`** | Automatically publishes and hosts the repository to GitHub Pages with 1 command | `npm run deploy` |
| **`prettier`** | Formats all HTML, CSS, JS, and Markdown files automatically | `npm run format` |
| **`eslint`** | Checks JavaScript files for linting and syntax best practices | `npm run lint` |

